{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tokenExchange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"subjectToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subjectTokenType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actorToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scopes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"audience","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resource","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ExchangedToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14ExchangedTokenV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"subjectToken","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"the token being exchanged — positional and first, because four","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"optional strings in positional order is a bug waiting to be written.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"subjectTokenType","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what kind of token "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subjectToken"},{"type":"text","text":" is. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Required","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.1), with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no default: a default would be this SDK choosing which kind of credential the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller holds, which is what §15.7 forbids. Pass "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/accessTokenType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same-domain exchange, or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/jwtTokenType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a trusted external issuer’s JWT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§15.7). This SDK never reads "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"subjectToken"},{"type":"text","text":" to decide the value: which kind of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token the caller holds is only the caller’s to know, AXIAM refuses refresh and ID"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token types by name, and a refusal is never retried as a different type."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"actorToken","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"its presence selects delegation; its absence selects impersonation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Two different operations with different risk, and §15.2 rule 1 forbids papering over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the difference: this SDK supplies no default actor token and never substitutes its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own session for one. Passing nothing here asks for impersonation, and the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses unless this client holds that grant."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"scopes","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"omit to inherit the subject’s, bounded by this client’s registration. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken\/scope","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is what was actually granted, which may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrower than what was asked for even on success (§15.2 rule 7) — read it."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What this deliberately does "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" do:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No retry, downgrade or rewrite on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unauthorized_client"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 2). It means","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either “this client may not exchange at all” or “this client may not impersonate”;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both are registration facts an operator must fix, and reworking the request into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegation would send one the caller did not write.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No auto-narrowing on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_scope"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 3). The server refuses rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"silently narrowing precisely so the caller finds out here."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No refresh token, ever","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 4). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenExchangeResponse"},{"type":"text","text":" has no such field,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has nowhere to put one, and this result never enters the §9"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single-flight refresh guard. Re-run the exchange to get a fresh token."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No adoption","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 5). The exchanged token is not this client’s session — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"even behind an opt-in flag, which is a MUST NOT here where adoption elsewhere is a MAY.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is a token to hand onward in one outbound call; adopting it would silently","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-privilege every subsequent call this client makes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A cross-tenant subject token answers ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_grant","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and this SDK does not try to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguish “wrong tenant” from “bad token” (§15.3): the server collapses them because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"telling them apart is a tenant-enumeration signal.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/tokenexchange(subjecttoken:subjecttokentype:actortoken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantid:configuration:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"code":"POST \/oauth2\/token","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the RFC 8693 grant (§15.1)."}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC13tokenExchange12subjectToken0fG4Type05actorG06scopes8audience8resource8tenantID13configurationAA09ExchangedG0VAA9SensitiveVySSG_SSAQSgSaySSGSgSSSgA2uA17OidcConfigurationVSgtYaKF","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","title":"tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tokenExchange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"subjectToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subjectTokenType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actorToken","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","text":"Sensitive","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"scopes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"audience","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resource","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tenantID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14ExchangedTokenV","text":"ExchangedToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/ExchangedToken":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ExchangedToken","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/exchangedtoken","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2\/token"},{"text":" with the RFC 8693 grant (§15.1) — a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"narrower","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}],"title":"ExchangedToken","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ExchangedToken","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/accessTokenType":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"title":"accessTokenType","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/accesstokentype","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"actor_token_type","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" this SDK sends, and the "},{"code":"subject_token_type","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" a caller names for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same-domain exchange of §15.1. There is no default: the type is a required"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter of "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/accessTokenType"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamClient/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","title":"tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:sc